      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nDocument the migration from `SharedStorageConnector` to `ExampleConnector` and refresh the KV connector inventory in the disaggregated-prefill guide.\r\n\r\nRelated to #49399.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n### Add a migration note\r\n\r\nAdd a warning callout to `docs/features/disagg_prefill.md` that:\r\n\r\n- States that `SharedStorageConnector` was renamed to `ExampleConnector` in #30201.\r\n- Shows the updated `--kv-transfer-config` snippet.\r\n- Clarifies that existing configurations only need to change the `kv_connector` value; `shared_storage_path` remains unchanged.\r\n\r\n### Refresh the connector inventory\r\n\r\nReplace the stale statement that the page supports “9 types of connectors” with the current `KVConnectorFactory` inventory:\r\n\r\n- Document all 16 registered connector implementations.\r\n- Group the connectors by purpose, including examples/debugging, LMCache, NIXL, local offloading, and other implementations.\r\n- Note that availability can depend on the platform and optional dependencies.\r\n- Keep the existing commonly used connector examples directly below the inventory.\r\n\r\n## Scope\r\n\r\nThis is a documentation-only change. It does not change connector behavior, add a deprecated alias, or update external blog/tutorial examples.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n- Ran `git diff --check`.\r\n- Ran `mkdocs serve` and reviewed the local documentation preview.\r\n- Manually compared all documented connector names with `vllm/distributed/kv_transfer/kv_connector/factory.py`.\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\n- `git diff --check` passed.\r\n- `mkdocs serve` started successfully and the local preview rendered the migration note and connector inventory correctly.\r\n- The documented connector inventory matches the factory registry.\r\n\r\n## AI assistance\r\n\r\nOpenAI Codex assisted with issue analysis, preparation of the documentation patch, and verification commands. I reviewed and understood every changed line and verified the connector inventory against the source before submitting.",
